  & 15.37 & ---
  & 1.39  & 0.40
  & 0.08  & 15.45
  & 8.23  & 31.01 \\
Grammar
  & 14.84 & $\downarrow$3\%
  & \textbf{0} & \textbf{0}
  & 0.08  & 14.92
  & 8.23  & 30.98 \\
GCD-equiv.$^\dagger$
  & 15.26 & $\downarrow$1\%
  & \textbf{0} & \textbf{0}
  & 0.04  & 15.30
  & 8.75  & 30.91 \\
Semantic
  & 11.65 & $\downarrow$24\%
  & 1.51  & 0.40
  & 2.71  & 14.36
  & 8.15  & 31.01 \\
S1
  & \textbf{0.93} & $\downarrow$\textbf{94\%}
  & \textbf{0} & \textbf{0}
  & 9.90  & \textbf{10.83}
  & \textbf{8.36} & 30.98 \\
S2
  & 0.97  & $\downarrow$94\%
  & \textbf{0} & \textbf{0}
  & 8.03  & \textbf{9.00}
  & 8.03  & \textbf{31.90} \\
