20	Yes. We use existing datasets (SciERC, DocRED, WikiEvents), pre-trained models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B, Llama-3.1-70B), and software libraries (XGrammar, vLLM, PEFT).
